  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex REXIS Comfort is a premium nylon multifilament designed to combine softness, comfort, feel and ball pocketing. It uses Yonex's FRF (Fusion of Resin Filament) manufacturing process and molecular-level Plasma Bonding, with FORTIMO™ polyurethane developed by Mitsui Chemicals filling the gaps between nylon filaments to improve elasticity, repulsion and durability. Within the REXIS family, Comfort occupies the soft and high-pocketing area of Yonex's official performance map, making it ideal for players of all swing speeds who prioritize a plush, arm-friendly stringbed.",

    "zh": "Yonex REXIS Comfort 是一款以 Softness、Comfort、Feel 和 Ball Pocketing 为核心的高端尼龙多芯球线。它采用 Yonex 的 FRF（Fusion of Resin Filament）制造工艺与分子级 Plasma Bonding 技术，并使用 Mitsui Chemicals 开发的 FORTIMO™ 聚氨酯材料填充尼龙纤维之间的空隙，从而提升弹性、回弹和耐久。根据 Yonex 官方 Comfort & Playability 图，REXIS Comfort 位于明显偏 Soft 且具有较深 Ball Pocketing 的区域，因此它比 REXIS Speed 更柔和，也比 REXIS Feel 更强调纯粹的舒适和线床柔软度。"
  },

